{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/oryp8fah","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":80,"top":288,"width":512,"height":162},"name":"矩形 7","text":"AND  R3, R2    ; isolate column (0x0F)\nCMP  R3, R2    ; rightmost column?\nJZ   GAME_OVER\nADDI R0, 0x01  ; one cell right","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F5F8FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/pc76hkr2","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":661,"top":274,"width":557,"height":190},"name":"矩形 8","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#12233A","lineColor":"#35516D","lineWidth":1,"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/h4bupgn6","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":681,"top":288,"width":517,"height":162},"name":"矩形 9","text":"LDR  R0, R3    ; read map cell\nCMP  R0, R1    ; wall or empty?\nJZ   DECAY_NEXT ; skip if needed\n...\nSUB  R0, R1    ; decrease body lifetime\nSTR  R3, R0    ; write map cell","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F5F8FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w32twb6l","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":60,"top":514,"width":1160,"height":70},"name":"矩形 10","text":"RAM 0x04–0x83 holds 128 cells: 0 = empty, 0xFF = wall, other values = body lifetime","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F5F8FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/v2tcn650","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":60,"top":605,"width":1160,"height":44},"name":"矩形 11","text":"The CPU scans the map, checks collisions and food, then sends a 140-byte state frame over UART.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#A9BBCD","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/u1kbu1ov","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":60,"top":655,"width":1160,"height":34},"name":"矩形 12","text":"Food uses a random empty cell; after 16 misses, a linear scan prevents endless retries.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#F5F8FC","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/x8f69ofe","slideIndex":5,"text":"With 16 columns, vertical moves add or subtract 0x10; AND 0x0F extracts the column for horizontal boundary checks. Each step scans 128 map cells, decreases body lifetimes, clears the tail, and writes the new head. The CPU checks collision and food. After 16 unsuccessful random food positions, it scans the board linearly. The code shown is an excerpt. About 80 seconds.\n\nSources: program/snake.asm."}